---
layout: base.njk
title: Posts
description: Latest posts from the performance-optimized blog
permalink: /posts/
---

<div class="container">
    <section class="hero p-lg">
        <h1 class="mb-md">Posts</h1>
        <p class="mb-lg">Notes on performance, Eleventy, and how this starter is put together.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="recent-posts">
        {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
        <article class="card mb-md">
            <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
            {% if post.data.description %}
            <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
            {% endif %}
            <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="btn">Read post</a>
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
    </section>
</div>
